71
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:46,639
Mr. Rapee likes the house smelling nice.

72
00:03:47,199 --> 00:03:50,599
P.S. If Mr. Rapee thinks of more rules, you’ll be informed.

73
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,360
Shit. My grill set.

74
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:54,918
