108
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:42,279
So I’ve got to keep up with them.

109
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:45,680
Oh.

110
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,120
Rule number one.

111
00:05:48,319 --> 00:05:49,639
No loud noise.

112
