118
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:12,480
That’s a human rights violation, you know.

119
00:06:13,439 --> 00:06:14,639
Rule number six.

120
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:17,439
Mr. Rapee does not like gamers.

121
00:06:21,680 --> 00:06:23,359
Don’t let me catch you playing
this stupid game in my house again. Understand?

122
00:06:23,360 --> 00:06:24,479
