126
00:06:35,720 --> 00:06:40,759
Second I hate gamers.

127
00:06:41,040 --> 00:06:41,959
Third

128
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,839
I hate gamers. Anything else?

129
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,480
There are three more, actually.

130
00:06:46,199 --> 00:06:48,519
I hate gamers.

131
00:06:48,920 --> 00:06:51,920
I hate ga... mers.

132
00:06:52,120 --> 00:06:53,120
Woo

133
00:06:53,399 --> 00:06:54,920
I hate gamers. Bye.

134
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,480
Bye.

135
