144
00:07:17,639 --> 00:07:18,399
Exactly.

145
00:07:18,399 --> 00:07:19,399
Hey

146
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:21,919
why don’t you stick to our original plan for now?

147
00:07:21,920 --> 00:07:24,278
The one where your beloved husband.

148
00:07:24,279 --> 00:07:26,119
The one where your beloved husband.

149
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:28,518
Think about it
With skills like ours,

150
00:07:28,519 --> 00:07:30,638
plus your husband’s money

151
00:07:30,639 --> 00:07:32,198
oh, I’m telling you,

152
00:07:32,199 --> 00:07:34,838
GP would totally go global.

153
00:07:34,839 --> 00:07:36,159
Global, huh?

154
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:38,039
Yeah. Like Thief and Titan.

155
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,199
Good.

156
00:07:39,959 --> 00:07:41,079
In that case,

157
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:43,039
I’m gonna use his money

158
00:07:43,040 --> 00:07:44,959
