159
00:07:45,680 --> 00:07:47,399
I’m gonna bleed him dry.

160
00:07:48,800 --> 00:07:51,278
How dare he stop Tep G from gaming?

161
00:07:51,279 --> 00:07:53,480
I’ve been playing since I was in my mother’s womb.

162
00:07:53,839 --> 00:07:55,360
Listen up, all of you.

163
00:07:55,759 --> 00:07:59,000
We’re going all the way
We’re not stopping at just the Pro League trophy.

164
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:00,560
After that,

165
00:08:00,879 --> 00:08:04,120
