166
00:08:04,639 --> 00:08:06,878
Backed by our investor.

167
00:08:06,879 --> 00:08:08,759
Ra... pee.

168
00:08:10,759 --> 00:08:18,759
Hahaha! Hahaha! Hahaha!

169
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:26,399
(Whistling)

170
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:36,480
Mm... mm... mm...

171
00:08:38,200 --> 00:08:43,519
Mm... haha... ahh...

172
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:53,639
You are responsible for all the housework.

173
00:08:56,240 --> 00:08:58,759
Sweeping, mopping everything.

174
00:09:00,879 --> 00:09:01,879
Wow.

175
