205
00:11:39,759 --> 00:11:43,279
I told you already for GP, I’ll do anything.

206
00:11:54,440 --> 00:11:56,638
Hey, what are you doing?

207
00:11:56,639 --> 00:11:58,518
Hey, what are you doing? Get out.

208
00:11:58,519 --> 00:12:01,398
Get out. Ow get out!

209
00:12:01,399 --> 00:12:04,360
Just transfer me the two million.

210
00:12:05,039 --> 00:12:06,120
