223
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:40,518
Yeah, but history’s not really my thing.

224
00:12:40,519 --> 00:12:42,200
But you know Professor Wanchai.

225
00:12:42,799 --> 00:12:43,799
Professor Wanchai?

226
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:47,360
No thanks. He’s way too brutal.

227
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:50,840
One million. Cash.

228
00:12:51,519 --> 00:12:52,879
Not enough.

229
00:12:54,879 --> 00:12:57,159
