00:47:30,239 --> 00:47:31,239
Yeah.

806
00:47:31,559 --> 00:47:32,559
- What?
- Uh...

807
00:47:34,320 --> 00:47:35,679
Well...

808
00:47:36,360 --> 00:47:38,158
You were the one talking like that.

809
00:47:38,159 --> 00:47:39,480
So I had to do that.

810
00:47:39,639 --> 00:47:40,400
What do you mean?

811
00:47:40,559 --> 00:47:42,719
Go all the way, huh?

812
00:47:42,880 --> 00:47:45,480
Ugh... I was sweating that much.
What was I supposed to say?

813
00:47:46,000 --> 00:47:49,239
Ugh... I was sweating that much.
What was I supposed to say? before you come in.

814
00:47:59,320 --> 00:48:01,159
- Can I ask you something?
- Hm?

815
00:48:03,199 --> 00:48:05,519
Are you hiding something from me?

816
00:48:12,079 --> 00:48:13,119
Shit.

817
00:48:15,199 --> 00:48:16,199
Uh...

818
00:48:17,880 --> 00:48:19,760
Why would you ask that, P’Pee?

819
00:48:28,039 --> 00:48:30,039
You said you wanted to be a chef, didn’t you?

820
00:48:30,440 --> 00:48:31,919
But ever since we started living together,

821
00:48:31,920 --> 00:48:33,800
But ever since we started living together,

822
00:48:35,559 --> 00:48:37,679
I haven’t seen you seriously cook once.

823
00:48:41,920 --> 00:48:44,519
You know you can’t do that, right?

824
00:48:45,719 --> 00:48:46,920
It’s just...

825
00:48:48,280 --> 00:48:49,280
Kao.

826
00:48:52,480 --> 00:48:54,239
When you have a dream,

827
00:48:54,880 --> 00:48:57,279
you have to really commit to it.
You can’t just think about it.

828
00:48:57,280 --> 00:48:59,679
You have to actually do it too. Got it?

829
00:49:01,840 --> 00:49:02,840
Yes.

830
00:49:03,159 --> 00:49:04,960
I’ll try harder.

831
00:49:05,559 --> 00:49:07,159
But you don’t have to worry, P’Pee.

832
00:49:07,400 --> 00:49:09,639
You can trust me. I can handle myself.

833
00:49:10,920 --> 00:49:11,920
Mm.

834
00:49:12,119 --> 00:49:13,440
Go all the way.

835
00:49:13,639 --> 00:49:15,759
Ha Ha.

836
00:49:15,760 --> 00:49:17,840
Hey, stop teasing me.

837
00:49:23,239 --> 00:49:24,599
- Hey, P’Pee.
- Hm?

838
00:49:24,840 --> 00:49:26,400
There’s something I want to ask.

839
00:49:27,119 --> 00:49:29,239
If you’re asking for money
or a room, the answer’s no.

840
00:49:29,400 --> 00:49:31,159
What kind of person do you think I am?

841
00:49:31,920 --> 00:49:33,199
Cute.

842
00:49:39,159 --> 00:49:42,320
I just wanted to ask...

843
00:49:43,679 --> 00:49:45,760
where did P’Phat go?

844
00:49:51,039 --> 00:49:53,159
- Dad, don’t.
- Stop playing that.

845
00:49:53,960 --> 00:49:55,360
Quit it. All of it.

846
00:49:56,199 --> 00:49:57,320
Dad...
